     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">Hi Friends,<br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">We&#39;re hosting the 3<sup>rd</sup> TEXATA Big Data Analytics World Championships (<a href=\"http://www.texata.com/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.texata.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241676987000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0opBS7VQ_f5j46eq92pXL2\">www.texata.com</a>) a fun, educational and challenging online global competition for professionals and university students looking to build their real-world skills in Big Data, Data Science, Machine Learning and Business Analytics. Two online rounds (4 hours each) and Live Top 12 World Finals in<b> Austin Texas</b>.  Round 1 Online starts on 30<sup>th</sup> September 2017 (5 weeks’ time). </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"> </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><b>Free Entry Code</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Participants can use the complimentary free entry code – </font><b><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">TEXAS17 ($0, normally $30) </font></b><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">and register at </font><a href=\"http://www.texata.com./\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.texata.com./&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241676987000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14iKSoabio4MgmjlGXXGxL\">www.texata.com.</a><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">  Feel free to share with any interested friends.</font></p><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"> <br></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">Best of luck!</p><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><b> </b><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><b><br></b></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><b><br></b></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><b>John R Persico</b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">Chief Organizer</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">TEXATA 2017</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">Big Data Analytics World Championships</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\">Two Online Rounds. Live Finals in Austin TX.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><a href style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jo...@texata.com</a> I <a href=\"http://www.te